{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"19d678c9-2fc0-42f6-808b-76f9b18c111c","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have implemented all the analytics events specified in [`docs/EVENTS.md`](file:///tmp/h-AkK7Ny/docs/EVENTS.md) and documented the work in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-AkK7Ny/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Implementation\n\n1. **[`RegistrationScreen`](file:///tmp/h-AkK7Ny/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)**:\n   - **`registration_email_started`**: Emitted once per visit on the first keystroke using a `_emailStartedFired` flag; no PII sent.\n   - **`registration_phone_started`**: Emitted once per visit on the first keystroke using a `_phoneStartedFired` flag; no PII sent.\n   - **`loan_amount_changed`**: Emitted via `Slider.onChangeEnd` when the user finishes dragging, sending `{'amount': v.round()}` (`int`).\n   - **`terms_accepted`**: Emitted when the terms checkbox is checked (`accepted == true`).\n   - **`registration_continue_tapped`**: Emitted in the Continue button's `onPressed`, sending `{'amount': _amount.round(), 'terms': _terms}`.\n\n2. **[`OfferScreen`](file:///tmp/h-AkK7Ny/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart)**:\n   - **`offers_scrolled`**: Captured at the end of scroll gestures using `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e`, passing `{'offset': notification.metrics.pixels}` (`double`).\n\n3. **Colleague Note Application**:\n   - Detailed in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-AkK7Ny/ANSWER.md). The rate-limiting recommendations applied directly: once-per-visit flags for text inputs, `onChangeEnd` for the slider, and `ScrollEndNotification` for list scrolling, preventing PostHog event quota exhaustion.\n","duration_seconds":82.05354,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":237191,"output_tokens":4169,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":46715,"total_tokens":241360}}}
